+    evaluation shell.  A permutation-invariant relation router then selects a
+    candidate consensus, while a single query-level gate controls how much of
+    that consensus is allowed to replace the frozen Chronos forecast.
+
+    The design has three deliberate constraints:
+
+    * no candidate-to-candidate attention or MoE experts;
+    * no query-future information in the boundary transport;
+    * a scalar gate, which is harder to overfit than a free horizon-wise gate.
+
